ven-names></name><name><surname>Moller-Madsen</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Heron</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The fall-off in serum concentration of tetanus antitoxin after primary and booster vaccination</article-title><source>Acta Pathol Microbiol Immunol Scand C</source><year>1986</year><volume>94</volume><fpage>77</fpage><lpage>82</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3739720</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schatz</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Ellis</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Ottendorfer</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Jodoin</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Barrett</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Atkinson</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Aging and the immune response to tetanus toxoid: diminished frequency and level of cellular immune reactivity to antigenic stimulation</article-title><source>Clin Diagn Lab Immunol</source><year>1998</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>894</fpage><lpage>896</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9801353</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Van Zeller</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Castro Soares</surname><given-names>AB</given-names></name><name><surname>Sampaio</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Caeiro</surname><given-names>FM</given-names></name><name><surname>Cayolla da Motta</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Programa Nacional de Vacina&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o (P.N.V.)</article-title><source>Sa&#x000fa;de P&#x000fa;blica</source><year>1968</year><volume>XV</volume><fpage>7</fpage><lpage>133</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Portugal. Minist&#x000e9;rio da Sa&#x000fa;de. Direc&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o-Geral da Sa&#x000fa;de</collab></person-group><article-title>Programa Nacional de Vacina&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o (Orienta&#x000e7;&#x000f5;es T&#x000e9;cnicas 10)</article-title><source>Lisboa</source><year>1991</year></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Portugal. Minist&#x000e9;rio da Sa&#x000fa;de. Direc&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o-Geral dos Cuidados de Sa&#x000fa;de prim&#x000e1;rios</collab></person-group><article-title>Programa Nacional de Vacina&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o (Orienta&#x000e7;&#x000f5;es T&#x000e9;cnicas 10)</article-title><source>Lisboa</source><year>2001</year></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Portugal. Minist&#x000e9;rio da Sa&#x000fa;de. Direc&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o-Geral da Sa&#x000fa;de</collab></person-group><article-title>Programa Nacional de Vacina&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o 2006. Orienta&#x000e7;&#x000f5;es T&#x000e9;cnicas</article-title><source>Circular Normativa N&#x000b0; 08/DT, 21/12/2005</source></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gon&#x000e7;alves</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Santos</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Cutts</surname><given-names>FT</given-names></name><name><surname>Barros</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Susceptibility to tetanus and missed opportunities in Portuguese women</article-title><source>Vaccine</source><year>1999</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>1820</fpage><lpage>1825</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10217579</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0264-410X(98)00481-2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Galazka</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Diphtheria</article-title><source>The immunological basis for immunisation</source><year>1993</year><publisher-name>Module 2: Document WHO/EPI/GEN/93.12. Geneva: World Health Organization</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Matos</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Rocha</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Corynebacterium dipgtheriae</article-title><source>PORTUGAL, Minist&#x000e9;rio da Sa&#x000fa;de, Direc&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o-Geral da Sa&#x000fa;de ed lit Avalia&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o do programa nacional de vacina&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o e melhoria do seu custo-efectividade: 2&#x000b0; inqu&#x000e9;rito serol&#x000f3;gico nacional Portugal Continental 2001&#x02013;2002</source><year>2004</year><publisher-name>Lisboa: DGS</publisher-name><fpage>69</fpage><lpage>80</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Efstratiou</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Maple</surname><given-names>PAC</given-names></name></person-group><source>Laboratory Diagnosis of Diphtheria</source><year>1994</year><publisher-name>Copenhagen, World Health Organization, EPI in the European Region</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dean</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name><name><surname>Dean</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Coulombier</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Brendel</surname><given-names>KA</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Burton</surname><given-names>AH</given-names></name><name><surname>Dicker</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name><name><surname>Sullivan</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Fagan</surname><given-names>RF</given-names></name><name><surname>Arner</surname><given-names>TG</given-names></name></person-group><source>Epi Info, version 6.04: a word processing, database and statistics program for epidemiology on microcomputers</source><year>2001</year><publisher-name>Atlanta, GA, USA: Centers for Disease Control and Prevention</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>StataCorp</collab></person-group><source>Stata Statistical Software</source><year>2001</year><publisher-name>Release 7.0. College Station, TX: Stata Corporation</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Altman</surname><given-names>DG</given-names></name></person-group><source>Practical statistics for medical research</source><year>1991</year><publisher-name>London: Chapman &#x00026; Hall</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Simonsen</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Block</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kl&#x000e6;rke</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kl&#x000e6;rke</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Heron</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Immunity against tetanus and response to revaccination in surgical patients more than 50 years of age</article-title><source>Surg Gynecol Obstet</source><year>1987</year><volume>164</volume><fpage>329</fpage><lpage>334</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3563844</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Castro</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Gon&#x000e7;alves</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Catarino</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Caracteriza&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o epidemiol&#x000f3;gica dos casos declarados de t&#x000e9;tano. Oportunidades perdidas de vacina&#x000e7;&#x000e3;o</article-title><source>Acta M&#x000e9;dica Portuguesa</source><year>2004</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>225</fpage><lpage>229</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>